<title>USA: Degussa unit to raise silica prices.</title>
<headline>Degussa unit to raise silica prices.</headline>
<dateline>RIDGEFIELD PARK, N.J. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Degussa Corp said Friday it will raise prices for all hydrophilic fumed silica grades by five percent, effective July 15.</p>
<p>Current prices will be in effect for orders shipped prior to July 15, the company said.</p>
<p>Degussa is the U.S. subsidiary of Degussa AG.</p>
